title: Diary
---
An old diary with empty pages.
Should I write something?
->Yes
->No
===
title: Book_Shelf
---
Old books covered with dust. 
Seems like no one had been using it for a long time...
Player: Uh... maybe let's not touch it. 
===
title: BR_Window
---
Player: Ew, spider web... Why is it so foggy?
Player: I can't even look outside properly...
Player: ... Hmm?
Player: There's no handle attatched to this. I can't open the window...
===
title: Blocked_Door
---
The door is blocked with wood planks.

->Open
    <<if $has_crowbar == true>>
        I can try with my crowbar... 
        (Sound of wood splintering!)
        The planks are gone. The path is clear.
        <<set $door_opened = true>>
    <<else>>
        I can't open that with my bare hands, I might need a tool.
    <<endif>>
    Player: I can't open this with my bare hands.
    Player: I might need to look for a tool...
->Ignore
    Player: It should be blocked for a reason...

