===
title: Cooking_Knife
---
It's a very sharp knife.
Player: Should I take it?

->Take it
    Player: This looks perfect to protect myself from danger...
    Chef: Hey! Hands off there!
    Player: S-Sorry, sir!
    I hurriedly put it down. I got scolded and didn't even get the knife...
->Leave it
    Well, I don't want to make any problems. 
===
title: Go_To_Sleep
---
Should I go to sleep?
-> Yes
    <<if $is_after_shift == true>>
        <<if $day_count < 3>>
            (You lay down and fall into a deep sleep...)
            <<set $day_count += 1>>
            <<set $is_after_shift = false>>
            Next day: Day {$day_count}.
        <<else>>
            (The three days are up. You've completed your time at the mansion...)
            The story concludes here.
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
        Player: I can't sleep yet! I need to finish my work shift in the office first.
    <<endif>>
-> No
    (You decide to stay up a bit longer.)
===
title: Office_Desk
---
<<if $is_after_shift == false>>
    Player: Should I start working?
    -> Yes
        Player: ......
        (Sounds of typing and organizing paperwork...)
        Player: My work is finished!
        <<set $is_after_shift = true>>
    -> No
        Player: I'll finish this up later.
<<else>>
    Player: I've already finished my shift for today. I should look around or head to bed.
<<endif>>
===
title: Flower_Pot
---
<<if $is_after_shift == false>>
    Player: Should I water this flower for my work shift?
    -> Yes
        <<start_watering_minigame>>
        // Wait until player finishes minigame, then complete shift
        <<set $is_after_shift = true>>
    -> No
        Player: I'll do it later.
<<else>>
    Player: The flower looks healthy and watered now!
<<endif>>
===
title: Fireplace
---
<<if $is_after_shift == false>>
    Player: The fireplace is cold. I should prepare some firewood.
    -> Light Fire
        <<start_fireplace_minigame>>
        <<set $is_after_shift = true>>
    -> Leave it
<<else>>
    Player: The fire is burning nicely now.
<<endif>>
===
title: Office_Frame
---
<<if $is_after_shift == false>>
